WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.100
The rest of the evidence covers audit,
privilege and the supply chain.

2
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.325
Job records and the activity
stream go to the SIEM.

3
00:00:07.325 --> 00:00:11.288
Least privilege comes from the
per-purpose credentials we just covered,

4
00:00:11.288 --> 00:00:14.987
and supply chain evidence comes
from pinned, verified collections.

5
00:00:14.987 --> 00:00:16.363
Then comes the payoff.

6
00:00:16.363 --> 00:00:21.435
Every job result goes to the program's
evidence store in the same shape every other

7
00:00:21.435 --> 00:00:25.538
tool uses, and because the inventory
came from the C M D B, each result

8
00:00:25.538 --> 00:00:30.163
already carries the configuration item
number that joins it all together.

9
00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:31.780
Now, the dangers.
